OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fthrough the day and a small chance of
OL,7,Fsome brighter spells in the afternoon.
OL,8,FTurning increasingly windy with strong
OL,9,Fgusts later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA drier and brighter evening
OL,12,Fas rain clears to the south. Clear
OL,13,Fskies for a time, before further cloud
OL,14,Fand rain pushes in from the west in
OL,15,Fthe early hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,18,Fday with brisk winds. Rain will ease a
OL,19,Flittle into the afternoon, becoming
OL,20,Fmore showery with a chance of brighter
OL,21,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
