OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy at first on Monday and
OL,7,FTuesday with showers possible at
OL,8,Ftimes. A chance of drier and brighter
OL,9,Fweather from Wednesday and turning
OL,10,Fincreasingly warm.
